<section class="hero">
  <h1>Bitcoin <em>Escape Velocity</em></h1>
  <div class="hero-subtitle">A retirement portfolio is supposed to draw down. Under bitcoin&rsquo;s historical growth curve there is a line past which yours runs up instead &mdash; and the surprise is how little it takes to cross it.</div>
  <p class="subtitle">How small changes in a bitcoin retirement plan compound into surprisingly large outcomes. Three numbers &mdash; when you retire, what you retire with, what you draw &mdash; and the year-by-year consequence, live.</p>
</section>

