    <p class="ev-lead">Your bitcoin stack will decrease over time as you draw on it; the open question is what its <em>purchasing power</em> does. Depending on your three variables, it may rise &mdash; and may reach escape velocity. Nothing here is a recommendation; the defaults are a starting position, not a target.</p>

